','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信调整短剧审核标准：12月起强制要求提交AI生成全流程证明视频</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI更新ChatGPT移动端界面并扩大Dots测试，接入Android健康数据</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">90位诺奖及图灵奖得主联名质疑Anthropic安全人设</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正研发通用型全功能AI代理，计划于2027年底正式发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/119548af0d0ca736099893bcd138f7ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司正加速研发一款通用型全功能AI Agent，旨在与OpenAI、Anthropic及Meta等竞品直接对垒，计划于2027年底发布。该项目由软件工程主管Craig Federighi主导，定位远超现有Siri及Apple Intelligence Suite，具备跨应用操作、网页浏览、代码编写、API调用及多步骤任务规划能力。为保障安全，苹果强调构建强权限模型与沙箱机制，延续端侧隐私保护策略。面对Meta Muse及Google Gemini等竞品在Mac端控制能力的渗透，苹果在macOS 27.3测试版中收紧生态权限，将第三方电脑控制工具的接入步骤从4步增加至14步。此举标志着系统级入口争夺战升级，苹果试图通过生态壁垒与自研AI Agent双管齐下，重构端侧AI竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型正式全量开源，支持百万上下文与MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/251646a3fd79fbdf3d24a2b3fcafa612.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，腾讯混元团队正式开源Hy4大模型，并同步在GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode上线模型权重，标志着混元LLM系列实现全量开源。Hy4采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量770B，激活参数49B，支持100万Token上下文窗口。同时开源的还有高性价比版本Hy4flash，其总参数量224B，激活参数12B，支持多模态输入与百万上下文。全系模型均采用Apache 2.0协议，允许商业使用与修改。腾讯官方同步发布了Hy4安全评估卡片，明确训练数据剔除了漏洞利用等攻击性内容，并经玄武与科恩实验室审计，未发现进攻性能力风险。此次开源覆盖了从旗舰版到轻量版的产品矩阵，为开发者提供了更灵活的部署选择，显著降低了企业级应用与二次开发的门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信调整短剧审核标准：12月起强制要求提交AI生成全流程证明视频</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4fd4b30eb28952348d85be073832bdf1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信短剧内容中心发布公告，宣布自2026年12月1日起实施两项审核新规。首先，短剧单集最低时长要求由45秒上调至1分钟，旨在提升叙事完整性。其次，针对包含AI生成内容的剧集，平台将“AI制作证明视频”由选填调整为必填项。创作者需提交包含资产列表、剧集列表、对应分镜提示词（Prompt）及部分分镜片段的证明材料，支持PDF、JPG、PNG及MP4格式，单文件不超过10MB，最多上传3个。此举旨在通过工程资产核验机制，解决生成式AI应用中常见的素材盗用与版权归属模糊问题。通过强制要求展示AI生成全流程，微信意在引导行业告别野蛮生长，推动AI短剧向规范化、精品化演进，同时减少因工程文件缺失导致的审核打回，提升平台整体审核效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI更新ChatGPT移动端界面并扩大Dots测试，接入Android健康数据</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2608a7c7bd332ed8fbb1f8c5903b7d56.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，OpenAI正式推送ChatGPT移动端界面改版，核心调整在于将Dots功能独立为底部标签页，并允许用户将Codex、Projects及Images等常用工具自定义固定至底部，以缩短高频功能访问链路。该更新主要面向ChatGPT Pro用户及部分符合条件的Plus用户，但欧洲经济区、英国、瑞士及韩国暂不开放。同时，Dots测试范围进一步扩大，已覆盖部分Plus用户及Business Standard用户。在健康生态方面，ChatGPT现已支持接入Android Health Connect，用户可同步睡眠与活动数据。Dots功能可调用上述健康信息提供主动式建议，如冲突日程提醒或预防性护理建议。此外，用户现可在ChatGPT桌面端基于健康数据搭建个人追踪网页。OpenAI表示，相关功能将按计划逐步向</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">90位诺奖及图灵奖得主联名质疑Anthropic安全人设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于北京时间11月20日正式登陆纳斯达克，IPO募资813亿美元，市值达1.271万亿美元，首日收涨17.07%。然而上市前夕，近90位诺贝尔奖、图灵奖及菲尔兹奖得主联合发布《MisAnthropic Statement》，公开质疑Anthropic的安全人设。联署者提出三重指控：一是批评其在警示递归自我改进AI风险的同时，仍将相关技术作为核心竞争力推进；二是质疑其利用安全形象吸引资本，实则降低安全标准并游说监管以获取竞争优势；三是认为其借公共安全之名垄断AI技术权力。尽管面临学术界与安全研究者的集体质疑，Anthropic仍创下史上最大规模股票发行纪录。此次事件揭示了AI行业在追求商业化扩张与维持安全承诺之间的深层裂痕，将“安全”与“生意”的矛盾直接带入公开市场，对后续AI监管及行业治理产生深</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
